  "text": "beUI Native is free — Pro mobile blocks and screens are in presale from $99\n\nReserve\nbeUI Pro for mobile\nbeUI\nComponents\nBlocks\nAgents\nCharts\nPlayground\nSponsors\nLight theme\nLight theme\nDark theme\nDark theme\nSystem theme\nSystem theme\n1.9k\nGet Pro\n\nINTRO\n\nHome\nCHARTS\n14\nSankey Chart\nNEW\nTreemap\nCandlestick Chart\nDonut Chart\nVolume Profile\nStatus Bar\nComposition Chart\nFunnel Chart\nLiquidity Heatmap\nBump Chart\nOrder Book\nHeat Calendar\nReturns Calendar\nPrice Target Fan\nCharts\nComposition Chart\nComposition Chart\nCopy Page\n\nStacked bar and area shares with period tooltips and a compact interactive legend.\n\nPreview\nPreview\nPreview\nUsage\nUsage\nCode\nCode\nSep 5\n100%\nAug 1\nSep 5\nOrganic search\n29.9%\nDirect\n22.4%\nReferrals\n22.3%\nSocial\n15.3%\nEmail\n6.2%\nOther\n3.9%\nSep 5\n100%\nAug 1\nSep 5\nOrganic search\n29.9%\nDirect\n22.4%\nReferrals\n22.3%\nSocial\n15.3%\nEmail\n6.2%\nOther\n3.9%\nInstall\n\nAdd it with the shadcn CLI, or copy the source manually.\n\nCLI\nCLI\nManual\nManual\nbun\nbun\nnpm\nnpm\npnpm\npnpm\nyarn\nyarn\n$ bunx --bun shadcn add @beui/\ncomposition-chart\ncomposition-chart\nAPI Reference\nCompositionChart\nseries\nreadonly CompositionSeries[]\n—\nperiods\nreadonly string[]\n\nUnique labels in chronological order.\n\n—\nview?\n\"area\" | \"bar\"\n—\nperiod?\nstring\n—\ndefaultPeriod?\nstring\n—\nonPeriodChange?\n((period: string) => void)\n—\nformatValue?\n((value: number) => string)\n—\nlabel?\nstring\n—\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nCompositionChartPlot\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nCompositionChartLegend\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nRelated components\nStatus Bar\n\nAnimated status history with rounded bars and period tooltips.\n\nLiquidity Heatmap\n\nAnimated liquidity bands across price and time, with a price trace and depth tooltips.\n\nBump Chart\n\nAnimated rankings with curved paths, interactive rank dots, and tooltips.\n\nAbout Composition Chart\n\nComposition Chart is an animated React 100 percent stacked chart that shows how shares of a whole change over time. The same component draws normalized stacked bars or stacked areas through its view prop, and bar segments spring to their new shares with Framer Motion. A shared tooltip shows each series' exact value and share with animated numbers, a compact legend highlights or pins a series, and periods with missing values are shown as gaps rather than interpolated.\n\nWhen to use it\nA product analytics page shows the mix of traffic sources or devices per month.\nA finance report tracks the share of revenue by plan or region over quarters.\nAn engineering dashboard shows how requests split across services or status codes over time.\nAccessibility\n\nPeriod inspection runs through an invisible native range input over the plot, so Arrow keys move between periods and the selected period is read out. Legend items are buttons that highlight a series on focus or hover, toggle a pinned state exposed with aria-pressed on click, and clear on Escape. With reduced motion enabled, bar segments and the period marker move without the spring.\n\nFAQ\nHow do I make a 100% stacked bar chart in React?\nInstall the chart with the shadcn CLI and pass series and periods to CompositionChart. Each series has an id, name, color and a values array aligned with periods.\nCan I switch between stacked bars and stacked areas?\nYes. Set view to bar or area. Both use the same data, legend and tooltip.\nCan I control the selected period?\nYes. Pass period and onPeriodChange for controlled use, or defaultPeriod for uncontrolled use. formatValue controls how values appear in the tooltip and legend.\n\nUpdated Oct 18, 2026\n\nbeUI\nPro\nLimited Offer\n\n300+ blocks and premium motion components for React and Next.js.\n\n$179 lifetime access\n\nExplore beUI Pro\nSponsors\n\nDIAMOND\n\nTracwell\n\nVisitor insights for growth\n\nIllos\n\nAnimated illustrations for product sites\n\nBecome a sponsor",
